'============================================================================
Sub Container0_Grid0_OnClickUp(lRow, szCellID)
	
	
	testA=Form.SetSharedData("selectedPid_search" , Container0.Grid0.GetCellData("bd_cell0", lRow)) '데이터가 잘 얻어지는거 메세지 박스로ok
